# tof_silent_api_takeoff_est_high.expect — API takeoff, ToF silent during the climb, hover-thrust estimate 28 % too high
# API 離陸の上昇中に ToF が出力停止、ホバー推力の見積もりが 28 % 高い
#
# Chain: as tof_silent_api_takeoff.expect (the API replies "error takeoff aborted", a second takeoff is
# refused up front), here with the estimate 28 % too high (fast climb) and the velocity-loop descent.
# 連鎖: tof_silent_api_takeoff.expect と同じ（API は "error takeoff aborted" を返し、二つ目の離陸は最初に
# 拒否される）。ここでは見積もりが 28 % 高く（速い上昇）、降下は速度ループ。
exit 0
log_contains any "cmd: takeoff"
log_contains any "ARM accepted"
log_contains any "Auto-takeoff engaged"
log_contains any "Downward ToF silent (>= 300 ms without a sample) in TAKEOFF/POS_HOLD → LANDING"
log_contains any "Blind landing: ToF silent, velocity loop"
log_contains any "reply: error takeoff aborted"
log_contains any "reply: error tof silent - check the sensor"
log_absent any "reply: error takeoff timeout"
log_absent any "Transition: TAKEOFF → FLYING"
log_absent any "touchdown by time"
order "Auto-takeoff engaged" "in TAKEOFF/POS_HOLD → LANDING"
order "in TAKEOFF/POS_HOLD → LANDING" "reply: error takeoff aborted"
order "reply: error takeoff aborted" "reply: error tof silent - check the sensor"
# Truth peak: measured 0.74 m (noise off) Bound 1.0 m.
# 真値の最高: measured 0.74 m (noise off)上限 1.0 m。
metric alt_max < 1.0 in 6.0 9.0
# Descent speed (truth) bound 1.25 m/s (measured 0.99 m/s). The thrust of the descent without a ToF is at most 0.95 x the support thrust
# (it cannot climb whatever the velocity estimate says), so once the velocity target is reached the descent speed is set by that ceiling (0.05 g), not by the PI.
# 降下速度（真値）の上限 1.25 m/s（実測 0.99 m/s）。ToF なしの降下の推力は高々 支持推力の 0.95 倍（速度推定が何であれ上昇できない）で、
# 速度の目標に達した後の降下速度は PI でなくその上限（0.05 g）で決まる。
metric descent_speed_max < 1.25 in 6.8 12.0
metric alt_max < 0.05 in 11.5 14.0
